n":"The only son of the great Eastern Han Confucian scholar Zheng Xuan. In the first year of Chuping, he was recommended as Filial and Incorrupt by Kong Rong, Chancellor of Beihai. In the first year of Xingping, when Kong Rong was besieged at Douchang by the Yellow Turban commander Guan Hai, Zheng Yi led his household troops to the rescue, falling in battle at the age of only twenty-seven.","jp":"後漢の大儒・鄭玄のひとり息子。初平元年、北海相の孔融に孝廉として推挙された。興平元年、孔融が黄巾軍の管亥に都昌で包囲されると、鄭益は私兵を率いて救援に向かったが戦死した。わずか二十七歳であった。","kr":"동한의 대유학자 정현의 독자이다. 초평 원년, 북해상 공융에게 효렴으로 천거되었다. 흥평 원년, 공융이 도창에서 황건적 관해에게 포위되자 정익이 가병을 이끌고 구원하러 갔으나 전사하였다. 향년 27세였다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1039015","remark":"","surname":"郑","surnameTc":"鄭","surnameEn":"Zheng","surnameJp":"鄭","surnameKr":"정","surnameOther":"","name":"益","nameTc":"益","nameEn":"Yi","nameJp":"益","nameKr":"익","nameOther":"","word":"益恩","wordTc":"益恩","wordEn":"Yi'en","wordJp":"益恩","wordKr":"익은","wordOther":"","icon":"郑益","power":"WJ10163","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"187","city":"CS1017","gender":"0","rule":"55","force":"50","wise":"70","politics":"55","charm":"78","will":"85","ruleTalent":"4","forceTalent":"6","wiseTalent":"9","politicsTalent":"7","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"7/7/57/7/7/73/27/7","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"1003705","warSoulPoint":"2600","battleSoulPoint":"600","debateSoulPoint":"5600","strategy":"1004308","strategy2":"1009601;1004401","professions":"0/0/0/1/0/0/1/3/2/1/2/0/3/1/0/4/2/4/3/0/1/0/1/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"5","compatible":"26","loyalty":"98","reputation":"9650","evaluate":"3000","title":"","rank":"8","birth":"168","show":"187","death":"1